&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;ASGARİ &amp;Uuml;RET TESPİT KOMİSYONU&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Denetimsiz bırakılan &amp;ldquo;gıda &amp;uuml;retiminin&amp;rdquo; getirdiği nokta ortada, denetimsiz bırakılan &amp;ldquo;ekonomi politikaları&amp;rdquo; &amp;uuml;lkeyi ne hale getiriyor ona da bakalım. Denetimsizlikten dolayı, sağlık sistemi nasıl &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;kt&amp;uuml;yse, &amp;ccedil;alışanın alım g&amp;uuml;c&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml; koruyacak mekanizmalar da &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;km&amp;uuml;ş durumda.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

